(PUBLIC SERVICE COMMISSION OF KENYA) Tj T*
(VACANCIES) Tj T*
(The Public Service Commission invites applications from qualified Kenyan citizens for the) Tj T*
(following vacancies in the Public Service.) Tj T*
(VACANCY NO. 1/2026: ASSISTANT OFFICE ADMINISTRATOR - CSG 11) Tj T*
(Number of Posts: Three \(3\)) Tj T*
(Terms of Service: Permanent and Pensionable) Tj T*
(Basic Salary: KSh. 38,270 - 49,950 per month) Tj T*
(Duties and Responsibilities) Tj T*
(An officer at this level will be deployed at the Commission headquarters in Nairobi to) Tj T*
(provide secretarial and administrative support, manage the registry, and handle routine) Tj T*
(correspondence.) Tj T*
(Requirements for Appointment) Tj T*
(For appointment to this grade, a candidate must have:) Tj T*
(\(i\) a Diploma in Secretarial Studies or an equivalent qualification from a recognised) Tj T*
(institution;) Tj T*
(\(ii\) a minimum of one \(1\) year of relevant experience in a busy office environment;) Tj T*
(\(iii\) proficiency in word processing and spreadsheet software.) Tj T*
(VACANCY NO. 2/2026: RECORDS MANAGEMENT ASSISTANT - CSG 12) Tj T*
(Number of Posts: Five \(5\)) Tj T*
(Terms of Service: Permanent and Pensionable) Tj T*
(Basic Salary: KSh. 30,550 - 39,720 per month) Tj T*
(Duties and Responsibilities) Tj T*
(Filing and retrieval of records, maintenance of the incoming and outgoing mail register,) Tj T*
(and preparation of monthly inventory reports.) Tj T*
(Requirements for Appointment) Tj T*
(For appointment to this grade, a candidate must have:) Tj T*
(\(i\) a Diploma in Records Management, Library Science or an equivalent qualification;) Tj T*
(\(ii\) no prior work experience is required; fresh graduates are encouraged to apply;) Tj T*
(\(iii\) a Certificate in Computer Applications from a recognised institution.) Tj T*
(VACANCY NO. 3/2026: SENIOR ICT OFFICER - CSG 8) Tj T*
(Number of Posts: One \(1\)) Tj T*
(Terms of Service: Permanent and Pensionable) Tj T*
(Basic Salary: KSh. 95,470 - 141,300 per month) Tj T*
(Duties and Responsibilities) Tj T*
(Provision of technical support, systems administration and supervision of ICT staff.) Tj T*
(Requirements for Appointment) Tj T*
(For appointment to this grade, a candidate must have:) Tj T*
(\(i\) a Bachelor's degree in Computer Science or Information Technology;) Tj T*
(\(ii\) a minimum of four \(4\) years of relevant experience in systems administration;) Tj T*
(\(iii\) certification in networking or cloud platforms will be an added advantage.) Tj T*
(APPLICATION PROCESS) Tj T*
(Applications should be submitted through the Commission's online portal.) Tj T*
(The closing date for all applications is 12th November 2026.) Tj T*
(The Public Service Commission is an equal opportunity employer.) Tj T*
